  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Policy Reform in Water Resources and Solid Waste II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a Reforma de Polticas en Recursos Hdricos y Residuos Slidos II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">El objetivo general del Programa es contribuir a la seguridad hdrica y a la sostenibilidad ambiental de Uruguay con un enfoque de circularidad, adaptacin y mitigacin al Cambio Climtico (CC). Los objetivos especficos son: (i) mejorar la gestin de los Recursos Hdricos (RH) y la calidad de los servicios de agua aumentando la resiliencia ante eventos extremos; y (ii) fortalecer la gestin de Residuos Slidos (RS) con enfoque de economa circular.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The overall objective of the Program is to contribute to Uruguay&apos;s water security and environmental sustainability through a focus on circularity, adaptation, and mitigation of climate change (CC). The specific objectives are: (i) to improve water resources (WR) management and the quality of water services by increasing resilience to extreme events; and (ii) to strengthen solid waste (SW) management with a circular economy approach.</narrative>
  </description>
